📱 Gardena Smart Water Control - Connectivity is key when it comes to smart irrigation, and this device delivers. Use weather data and app-based schedules to automate your watering routine, and enjoy 36 cycles per day and frost alerts. Compatible with HomeKit and Alexa, it's the perfect choice for connected gardeners like yourself. ($$$)

🎨 Claber Oasis - Looking for something compact and easy to use? The Claber Oasis fits the bill! This gravity-fed automatic drip system waters up to 20 plants for 40 days with four programmable settings. Plus, its battery operation means no electricity needed, making it perfect for vacation watering or plant care in patios and greenhouses. ($)$

